<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1">: I'll try sending her a message.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She must be worn down mentally, and I hope it encourages her, even a little.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and I parted ways, and I'm home now. When it looks like you can go home, please get in touch again.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If possible, when </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> goes home, I want to be the one to go get her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is involved in the incident, going home is dangerous.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then, a reply came right away.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“Sorry about everything today. I'm waiting for my </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s interview to finish.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s still at the police station, then. It's probably the safest place there is.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, next door to </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s home, there is </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is involved in the incident, I absolutely must not let her get close.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“You must be tired. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, why don't you come to my place? Waiting alone must be hard, right?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“Thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. But, I'm fine. If I did that, my </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> would be home alone.”</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">True, I also have to make sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is safe.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, how should I explain it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might be the killer, so don't go home, or something?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm sure </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> wouldn't believe something like that. If I don't find a clever way to hold </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> back, there's no telling what will happen.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“Then, couldn't you ask them to let you stay the night at the police station? That way, your </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> would be with you too, right?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, realize it somehow...!</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you're kind. But, it seems the police don't have anywhere they can let us stay. Besides, I have to hurry and get ready for my </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s funeral. </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, too, can come home tomorrow morning, they said.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, no, you can't go home! I have to stop her somehow.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, this is a strange question, but isn't your intuition sensing any danger?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“No, for now I'm fine. What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">? You're acting strange?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is so frustrating! When it might be dangerous! What happened to her usual intuition!?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, an incoming call came in on my phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s calling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hello!? </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>... You seemed kind of off, so I called."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s voice was unusually gentle. Had she regained a little of her composure?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">No, never mind that now; there's no telling when her </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s questioning will end!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"S-</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="2">! I'm scared! Right now, by myself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the spur of the moment, I had blurted out something strange.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Trying somehow to make a situation where I could be with </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, I had said something this needy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even though right now </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> is going through such a hard time.</STYLE><PG>
"Heh, really, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>. You really are my cute junior. Then, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, come over to my place. That way we can be together, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">True, that way we could be together, but in the apartment next door lives </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Spending the night at Zahha would probably be impossible too, in </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s situation right now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"All right. I'm sorry, please let me do that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, I'll be her bodyguard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I may not be much to rely on, but if I stay on guard at all times, I can manage somehow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I stay awake and keep watch, we'll surely make it to morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll lock up perfectly too, and never open the door, no matter who comes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, first, a thorough check of the inside of the apartment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Someone might already be hiding in there.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="2">, when can you leave? I'll come pick you up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If it's just me, I can leave anytime. It looks like the police will drive my <STYLE ID="8">mom</STYLE> home."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All right, the sooner the better. Once we meet up, I'll have </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> send </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> a lie, a message saying she'll be late.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The later it gets, the harder this trick is to use.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then I'll head over now. Please wait for me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just in case, I'll bring anything that could work as a weapon.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "11" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">A hammer... a kitchen knife... a frying pan...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A box cutter, plus... a small saw... a wrench...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I don't see any weapon that would be much use in my hands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, it's still far more reassuring than nothing, I suppose.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But, if a police officer on the lookout stops and questions me, I might get taken in for violating the weapons law.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, I can't be worrying about that kind of thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can just say I'm carrying them for self-defense, and I really am carrying them for self-defense.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That kind of excuse probably wouldn't work.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If, while I'm going home with </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, I get stopped and questioned, I might be the only one taken to the police station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If that happened, I'd end up putting </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> in even more danger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For now, I'll wrap just the kitchen knife, the dangerous-looking one, in a towel and tuck it inside my clothes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Splitting up my things should make it easier to fool people's eyes.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, I also have to pack a change of clothes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And also, my phone charger. I'll put these in my backpack, so I won't stand out while I'm on the move.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島リュック大.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島リュック.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I looked at my reflection in the mirror, backpack on my back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's a little big for me to be carrying...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Anything smaller than this wouldn't fit everything, anyway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I'm getting around by bicycle, well, it's probably fine.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家夜.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜ブラー.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I jumped on my bicycle and headed for the police station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm moving this fast. I should get to </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> first.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might be lying in wait near the police station, though.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, that can't be. If she's going to lie in wait, home should be more convenient in every way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's fine. My back is packed full of weapons.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now then, Operation start.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
